# Published records

Every published post has a unique slug, a title, a description, and a `YYYY-MM-DD` date.

- `draft: true` stays out of the index, the sitemap, and static paths.
- Do not add a post to make the blog look fuller.
- Experience and services stay as recorded. Do not embellish them.
- External URLs in site content are `https` links with no embedded credentials.
